    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d264-a1">

                <pb facs="0473" n="411" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg411"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. A. Nones &amp; Co. to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 16,
                        1877</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Honorable Sir</hi>: As established merchants in this
                    city, doing business with the republic of Hayti, we have protested against the
                    imposition of the one per cent. consular fees charged on the gross amount of
                    invoices shipped by us to the said island of Hayti, and respectfully inclose a
                    copy of the protest which we have lodged with the Haytian consul at New
                    York.</p>
                <p>Requesting your kind attention to the same, we are,</p>
                <p>Your obedient servants,</p>
                <closer>A. NONES &amp; CO.</closer>




